              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CHELS"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My boyfriend requests these all the time in the summer! He loves spicy burgers, and this one really seemed to hit it home. Because of this, I up the amount of green chiles -because he likes it hot-, and I accompany them with the chipotle mayo from this site.",
